@baseUrl = https://courseplatform-p8b0.onrender.com
@authToken = replace-with-a-valid-courseplatform-jwt

### Start Dropbox OAuth setup while signed in to the Dropbox account to connect
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dropbox/connect

### Callback without the matching OAuth state cookie is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dropbox/callback?code=example&state=invalid

### Verify the configured Dropbox connection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dropbox/connection
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
